## Commands

Run from repo root (activate `.venv/bin/activate` first, or prefix with `.venv/bin/`):

- `pytest -q` — full test suite (tests live under `tests/`; `src/` is on pythonpath via `pyproject.toml`).
- `ruff check .` — lint across repo.
- `ruff format --check .` — format check.
- `mypy src` — type check services/libs.

See `docs/superpowers/pilot/runbooks/quality-gates.md` for the full command matrix and story-scoped selectors.

